# Generated artifacts

## UIO Definition

### ipc-shm

```dts
ipc-shm@20482000 {
    compatible = "generic-uio";
    reg = <0x0 0x20482000 0x0 0x4000 0x0 0x20486000 0x0 0x4000>;
    status = "okay";
};
```

### mu1

```dts
mu1@44220000 {
    compatible = "generic-uio";
    reg = <0x0 0x44220000 0x0 0x20000>;
    interrupts = <GIC_SPI 224 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
    status = "okay";
};
```

